<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Kemayan 6-mth net up 32.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Kemayan 6-mth net up 32.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  13.34   vs	  10.03</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  3.84   vs	   3.18</p>
<p>    Turnover		   368.69   vs	 224.55</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    28.06   vs	  19.66</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  1.79   vs   less  0.98</p>
<p>    Dividend			 -    vs	     -</p>
<p>NOTE - Kemayan Corp Bhd is involved in palm oil cultivation, construction and property businesses.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
